                                "sense_id": "d0c610e6-a496-3d74-ad16-49fe5f483774",
                                "text": "Succourleſs as I was, and enfeebled by having ſo long contended with the boiling torrent, I gave myſelf up for loſt, when, as a laſt effort, I hallooed as loud as I could;⁠—[…]"
