                                "sense_id": "d0c610e6-a496-3d74-ad16-49fe5f483774",
                                "text": "For in their succorless empty-handedness, they, in the heathenish sharked waters, and by the beaches of unrecorded, javelin islands, battled with virgin wonders and terrors that Cooke with all his marines and muskets would not willingly have dared."
